  {"i":453,"t":["movement"],"n":"Teacher B: 'deteriorate/be downgraded' is a figurative extension of going down, taught with the same verb, not a separate unit."},
  {"i":503,"t":["people"],"s":{"2":["qualities"]},"n":"Teacher B: 'grow up' is about people, but 'become big' in general (things, numbers) is a common size-change sense."},
  {"i":504,"t":["character","communication"],"n":"Teacher B: ふざける is joking and messing about, which is behaviour and playful talk, not a hand or body action."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":461,"keep":[],"n":"Holding one's liquor is a colloquial extension (いける口); learners mainly meet いける as 'good/doable', so it isn't worth teaching in the drink unit."},
  {"i":462,"keep":[2],"n":"'My type' (私のタイプ) is very common and fits a unit on people's looks and personality."},
  {"i":468,"keep":[3],"n":"とんでもないです as a polite reply to thanks is a common set phrase worth teaching with greetings."},
  {"i":473,"keep":[2],"n":"円 as 'circle' is a basic shape word and belongs in the colours and shapes unit."},
  {"i":503,"keep":[2],"n":"'To get bigger' (大きい+なる) is a common sense, taught alongside size adjectives in qualities."},
  {"i":521,"keep":[1],"n":"この先 as 'ahead, beyond this point' is common in directions and signs, so it fits position."},
  {"i":542,"keep":[2],"n":"つき as 'month' (月に一回, ひと月) is common and fits calendar."},
  {"i":575,"keep":[2],"n":"木 as 'wood, timber' (木の机) is common and fits natural materials in nature."},
  {"i":591,"keep":[],"n":"Learners meet the sports sense as 金メダル rather than bare 金, so it isn't taught in sports on its own."},
  {"i":599,"keep":[4],"n":"いずれ as 'sooner or later, someday' is a common N3 time adverb."}
 ]
